 """Table for editing optimization constraints. Each row has a relation
-(>, <, =), threshold value, and criticality flag. Supports drag-and-drop
+(>, <, =), threshold value, stopping flag (critical: the run stops on a violation),
+and risk tolerance (the largest modeled chance of a violation the optimizer may propose;
+FermiBadgerPlugins patch badger-1.6.0-constraint-risk-tolerance). Supports drag-and-drop
 reordering."""
 
 from typing import Any
 from PyQt5.QtWidgets import (
+    QAbstractSpinBox,
     QCheckBox,
     QComboBox,
